Source: gogoham
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Franz DO2GGH <do2ggh.de@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, pybuild-plugin-pyproject, python3-all,
 python3-setuptools, python3-wheel
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/do2ggh/GoGoHam
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gogoham
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui,
 python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtmultimedia, python3-pyside6.qtnetwork,
 python3-pyside6.qtsvg, python3-numpy, libhamlib-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: python3-pyside6.qttexttospeech, speech-dispatcher, qt6-speech-speechd-plugin, espeak-ng,
 qt6-translations-l10n
Description: contest logger for Linux with live dupe check and live score
 GoGoHam is a contest logger for Linux: fast entry, live dupe check, live points
 and multipliers while typing, CAT control via Hamlib, QSOs from WS,
 Cabrillo and ADIF export, DX cluster with band map, grayline map and a
 practice mode. 50 HF and VHF contests as readable rule files.
